  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">지난번에 지구젤리를 활용한 일주운동 모형 탐구활동을 고민한다며 글을 올렸었는데요~</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8b46f1c1371e40d64d51a60f2ab848ee759585da\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8b46f1c1371e40d64d51a60f2ab848ee759585da\" data-origin-width=\"3000\" data-origin-height=\"4000\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">이렇게 만들어보려다가 너무 손이 많이 가기도 하고.. 이미 반구는 활용을 한 이후라서</span><br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">간단히 그냥 지구젤리랑 이쑤시개만으로 하는 만드는 버전으로 바뀌었습니다..ㅎ</span><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4110086e1f88b42c2c6e90e99920424513bc8764\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4110086e1f88b42c2c6e90e99920424513bc8764\" data-origin-width=\"1920\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f28f2982ad769e691a54d1c8e72b9f0dec76c999\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f28f2982ad769e691a54d1c8e72b9f0dec76c999\" data-origin-width=\"1920\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/724c9f1b643b09142663125acae0ddc17c6aa4f5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/724c9f1b643b09142663125acae0ddc17c6aa4f5\" data-origin-width=\"1920\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/71f59b9810a099cf6f0c4da850976eca590e57b5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/71f59b9810a099cf6f0c4da850976eca590e57b5\" data-origin-width=\"1920\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/74daa629089763366dfb49f4661f35b84c2a920c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/74daa629089763366dfb49f4661f35b84c2a920c\" data-origin-width=\"1920\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/aa6e4aa0b2b6ac87bd084cc623d398de205ace42\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/aa6e4aa0b2b6ac87bd084cc623d398de205ace42\" data-origin-width=\"1920\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4b5bafc8d381c1b792796de13543f4ee4234b840\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4b5bafc8d381c1b792796de13543f4ee4234b840\" data-origin-width=\"1920\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2990d2cd69bd8e84e0d73335f6a0f3a6dbc202a7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2990d2cd69bd8e84e0d73335f6a0f3a6dbc202a7\" data-origin-width=\"1920\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">이상 지구젤리가 먹고싶은 개인적인 욕심으로 만든 일주운동 탐구활동 소개였습니다.ㅎ<br>오류는.. 심각한 것이 아니라면 그냥 맛있게 먹고 넘어갈게요..ㅎ</p><div class=\"figure-fi